        "heading": "What are the contract sizes and main markets?",
        "body": "Oracle Health Government Services received 30 awards in FY2026 to date, with an average award size of $68.8M and total obligations of $2.1B. Computer Systems Design Services is the largest market at $2.1B, with smaller markets including Computer Facilities Management Services at $3.6M and Used Household and Office Goods Moving at $110K."
      }
